review:
[h1]What ESO have:[/h1]
     - Exploration;
     - Nice stories;
     - Customization;
     - Nice combat system;
     - Housing;
     - Nice community;
     - Dungeons and trials;
     - Nice PVP and PVE content;
     - More exploration;
     - Nice store system;
     - Loreplay;
     - Nice elfs.

[h1]What ESO do not have:[/h1]
     - Nice animations;
     - Good free contents; 
     - You.

[i]That was a clean review. Thanks and take care.[/i]
